[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5885.27, "timestamp": "01:38:05", "text": "你可以這麼說。這樣一來，你就不會遇到那些會破壞你頻道、影響你心態、影響你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5891.75, "timestamp": "01:38:11", "text": "精神狀態等等的壞人。因為"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5898.229, "timestamp": "01:38:18", "text": "當你積極地與他人公開合作時，無論規模大小，總是會遇到一些害群之馬，他們會影響你的心理健康，也會影響你的頻道，甚至可能導致你被封鎖等等。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5903.877, "timestamp": "01:38:23", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/6_cfY8HJH8bV5QS5yYDYDg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5915.669, "timestamp": "01:38:35", "text": "所以為了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5918.39, "timestamp": "01:38:38", "text": "篩選掉這些害群之馬，建立一個真正值得信賴的空間，呃，你就會聽到那個笑話。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5921.755, "timestamp": "01:38:41", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "me taking notes on the sideline-"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5928.95, "timestamp": "01:38:48", "text": "我覺得你沒問題。哦，開始吧，我就開始說了，你知道，我一說起話就停不下來，但我就是這麼說的。你也是這麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5938.07, "timestamp": "01:38:58", "text": "理解的，因為我當時也在做筆記。好的。還有，你好，歡迎來到"}]